:question/problem "What is $\\displaystyle \\int\\frac{1}{x^{2}} - 3xdx$?"}] :knowledge-point/title "Computing an Integral Using the Sum and Constant Factor Rules"} {:knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186184003 :question/id #uuid "8f99b603-2fba-5a58-9966-b91d3a8a773e" :question/is-example true :question/math-academy-id "e-373" :question/problem "Calculate $\\displaystyle \\int \\left(5(\\sqrt{x})^{3} - 4 x^2 + 5\\right) \\,\\textrm d x$." :question/worked-solution "Using the sum and constant factor rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\int(5(\\sqrt{x})^{3} - 4x^{2} + 5)dx &= \\int(5x^{3/2} - 4x^{2} + 5)dx \\\\\n&= 5\\intx^{3/2}dx - 4\\intx^{2}dx + 5\\int1dx \\\\\n&= 5(\\frac{x^{5/2}}{\\frac{5}{2}}) - 4(\\frac{x^{3}}{3}) + 5(x) + C \\\\\n&= 5 \\cdot \\frac{2}{5}x^{5/2} - \\frac{4}{3}x^{3} + 5x + C \\\\\n&= 2\\sqrt{x^{5}} - \\frac{4}{3}x^{3} + 5x + C\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "007f3355-427a-5da4-8af7-22581f1cb1de" :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186184502 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9e5ce597-62ea-54d2-8f1a-415f3eedcc86" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x^{3} - 3\\sqrt{x^{3}} + 6x}{3} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186181417} {:answer/id #uuid "c47182fe-b5f7-5ab7-9468-8e985b6c0a96" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x^{3} - 2\\sqrt{x^{3}} + 2x}{3} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186181418} {:answer/id #uuid "c8c0f99f-f43c-5656-ad88-f62d9b27ccb1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x^{3} + 2\\sqrt[3]{x^{2}} + 2x}{3} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186181419} {:answer/id #uuid "39ee7c07-44d7-5ef5-97de-7c0090d83f08" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x^{3} + 3\\sqrt{x^{3}} + 6x}{3} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186181420} {:answer/id #uuid "5e14c783-f2a2-5eff-9bda-e48e2bc22284" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x^{3} - 2\\sqrt{x^{3}} + 6x}{